  "id": "compact",
  "description": "Deterministic migration-focused Savant projection. Preserves a complete hash-addressed file manifest and emits only the highest-value current authority and implementation bodies under a hard content budget. Replayable history, generated projections, caches, archives, bulky derivatives, and secret-bearing artifacts remain excluded.",
